    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d63-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d63-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Transmits study on capabilities of forces for limited military
                    operations. Top Secret; Special Limited Distribution. Se 7 pp. NARA, RG 59, S/S–NSC Files: Lot 63 D 351.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d63-f2" n="2" xml:id="d63-f2-content">
                <p>Study not enclosed. [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
